      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to search for businesses by name, location (lat/long), and category\n2. Users should be able to view businesses (and their reviews)\n3. Users should be able to leave reviews on businesses (mandatory 1-5 star rating and optional\ntext)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
